<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1052" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγχί-στροφος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>turning closely,
				quick-swooping</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰκτῖνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thgn.
					1261
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>quick-changing, changeable</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγχίστροφα βουλεύεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.13
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. μεταβολή</span>
			<i>sudden</i> change, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.53
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀστάθμητον πρᾶγμα εὐτυχία καὶ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					4.23
				</span></i>
			:—Rhet., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἀ.</span>
			<i>rapidity of transition</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Longin.
				27.3
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁρμονία ἀ. περὶ τὰς
			πτώσεις</span> a style <i>flexible</i> in the use of the
			cases, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Comp.</u>
				22
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-φως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Longin.
					22.1
				</span></i>
			.</div>
